      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>Those are good for general resilience, but they're a bit too \"textbook.\" I'm looking for things that are more specific to the actual behavioral patterns you see in those environments—like how people communicate or react in high-tension situations. Could you suggest some questions that focus more on specific social traits or typical ways of interacting that characterize these urban groups? Maybe things related to how they handle conflict or their use of specific slang/vernacular in social settings?",
